# Filled-in plugin configuration — real accounts, paths, and channel names. Never commit.
# The `setup` skill normally writes this outside the repo entirely (see shared/capabilities.md),
# but these patterns cover the legacy in-repo location and any local scratch copy.
# Unanchored so they match at any depth, including plugins/*/shared/config.md.
**/shared/config.md
**/.executive-assistant/config.md

# Python bytecode from the bundled scripts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
